@@ -426,6 +426,15 @@ animation_duration_ms <value>
 	Draws every window but the focused one at _value_ (0 to 1), on top of
 	its own *opacity*. 1, the default, turns it off.
 
+*workspace_swipe* off|<fingers> [invert]
+	A horizontal touchpad swipe with _fingers_ fingers moves the active
+	workspace with the fingers and brings its neighbour on the same output
+	in beside it; letting go switches to it when the swipe went far or fast
+	enough, and slides back otherwise. Content follows the fingers: moving
+	right brings in the workspace before. _invert_ turns that round. A
+	vertical swipe with the same fingers goes to *bindgesture* as usual.
+	Best with *workspace_animation slide*. Default is _off_.
+
 *workspace_animation* fade|slide
 	How switching workspaces is animated, when *animation_duration_ms* is
 	set: _fade_ (the default) fades the old workspace into the new one;
